  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>In the directories</head>
        <p>J. R. Shackleton, butcher, is listed at No. 194 <ref target="civic?id=Queensberry%20Street">Queensberry Street</ref> in 1905, on the Bouverie Street corner.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>On the electoral roll</head>
        <p>Jarvis Shackleton, butcher, is on the 1905 <ref target="civic?id=Electoral-Rolls">electoral roll</ref> at 194 Queensberry Street. Mary Ann and Mary Elizabeth Shackleton, home duties, and Thomas Shackleton, mason, are at the same address.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Neighbours</head>
        <p>Naham Haskin, draper, is next door at No. 192.</p>
      </div>
